=== A: the first FIFO, full against the ghost count
--- informal-kind, limit 5s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
Full_A                       assert  cex           informal-kind depth 4
Full_C                       cover   unreachable   informal-kind
--- informal-kind, limit 5s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
Full_A                       assert  cex           informal-kind depth 16
Full_C                       cover   unreachable   informal-kind
=== B: the repaired FIFO, against a five-bit count
--- informal-kind, limit 5s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
NoOverflow_A                 assert  proven        informal-kind
Full_A                       assert  proven        informal-kind
--- informal-kind, limit 5s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
NoOverflow_A                 assert  cex           informal-kind depth 2
Full_A                       assert  cex           informal-kind depth 1
=== C: the repaired FIFO's pointers stay below DEPTH
--- informal-kind, limit 5s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
Ptr_A                        assert  proven        informal-kind
Full_C                       cover   covered       informal-kind depth 5
--- informal-kind, limit 5s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
Ptr_A                        assert  cex           informal-kind depth 6
Full_C                       cover   covered       informal-kind depth 6
--- informal-kind, limit 5s for each property
property                     type    status        engine     detail
Ptr_A                        assert  proven        informal-kind
Full_C                       cover   covered       informal-kind depth 9
verdict: a counterexample at DEPTH 4 is the bug at 16; proofs at 16, and at 4 and 8, say nothing about 32 or 5
